# AI Assistance Disclosure:
# Tool: Claude Code (model: claude-opus-5), date: 2026-10-16
#  2026-10-16: Week 7/8 catch-up - test-only configuration. Points the suite at a
#    dedicated database and at the least-privilege role, so tests run under the same
#    privileges as production (NFR8.2.3).
#    No requirements, architecture, schema, or API decisions were made by the AI tool.
#    Author review:
#
# Committed deliberately: these are throwaway local values, not secrets. The database
# is dropped and recreated on every run.

PORT=3003
NODE_ENV=test

DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5435

# Must end in _test; globalSetup refuses to drop anything else.
DB_NAME=credit_db_test

# A test-only copy of the least-privilege role, with the same grants. Deliberately NOT
# credit_app: that role belongs to the running service, and globalSetup resets the
# password of whatever role it is given.
DB_USER=credit_app_test
DB_PASSWORD=credit_app_test_password

# Owner credentials, used only by tests/setup/globalSetup.ts to build the database.
# Must match CREDIT_DB_USER / CREDIT_DB_PASSWORD in the root .env.
DB_OWNER_USER=credit
DB_OWNER_PASSWORD=credit
